# Associative algebra
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Definition2.2.1"
number := false
%%%
*Definition 2.2.1.* An *associative algebra* over $`k` is a vector space $`A` over $`k` together with a bilinear map
$`A \times A \to A`, $`(a, b) \mapsto ab`, such that $`(ab)c = a(bc)`.
